{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_053E80","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"The Boss骑过的那匹白马……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":38,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"你说那匹安达卢西亚马？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"那匹马为什么会在哥斯达黎加？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"是我找到它的。虽然不会说话，但它是她最后的见证者。我把它带到了这里。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":102,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"在哪找到的？我还以为它被那场轰炸波及了……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"我想尽了各种办法寻找……最后是在英国的骑乘马市场找到的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"英国？你是说它从苏联境内翻过乌拉尔山脉，又渡海到了英国？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"谁知道。也许有人把它带出去的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"你没想过，那只是另一匹长得很像的安达卢西亚马吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"没有确证……不，应该说以前没有。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"什么意思？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"你应该最清楚。那匹马绝不让任何人骑。我也被它甩下来过好几次。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"可它唯独让你骑上了背……虽然不愿承认，事实就是如此。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"……结果让它太勉强了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"但最后那次奔跑，完全不像一匹老马。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"拼尽全力追赶昔日的主人……作为一匹马，也许那正是它所愿。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""}]}